creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>One spawn in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Falcon%20Bastion\">Falcon Bastion</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33358,31314,5\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33358, 31314, 5)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tThe Thawing Dragon Lord uses both Ice and <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire</a> attacks. However, the <b>Ice Crystal Bomb</b> is used almost every turn, significantly increasing melee damage, resulting in nearly 1,000 damage each turn, regardless of positioning.<br/><br/>A Thawing Dragon Lord attacks in melee range. A Thawing Dragon Lord will retreat at 150  (0.6%, deep red) health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tStay diagonal to it as it because its strongest attack is the Fire Wave that deals massive damage.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 368 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><sm